---
import LegalWrapper from '@/components/LegalWrapper.astro'
import { localeHelper } from '@/i18n'
const { t } = localeHelper(Astro)
---

<LegalWrapper t={t}>
  <article class="legal-page">
    <header class="legal-header">
      <h1>PRIVACY POLICY</h1>
      <p>
        At <strong>ZCFLOW</strong>, we value our users' privacy and are committed to protecting the
        personal data we collect through our website <a
          href="https://www.zcflow.com"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer">www.zcflow.com</a
        > and the commercial interactions associated with our solution.
      </p>
      <p>
        This Privacy Policy describes how we collect, use, store, and protect the personal data of
        individuals and legal entities, as well as their representatives, collaborators, and
        authorized users, in accordance with <strong
          >Law No. 29733 – Personal Data Protection Law</strong
        >, its Regulations, and other applicable laws in the Republic of Peru.
      </p>
      <p>
        Everything stated in the Personal Data chapter is governed by Law No. 29733. Any omissions
        shall be supplemented by the provisions of said law or applied directly.
      </p>
    </header>

    <hr />

    <section>
      <h2>1. Controller of Personal Data</h2>
      <dl>
        <div><dt><strong>Corporate Name:</strong></dt><dd class="description-text" class="description-text">SEIDOR CONSULTING PERU S.A.C.</dd></div>
        <div><dt><strong>Trade Name:</strong></dt><dd class="description-text">ZCFLOW</dd></div>
        <div><dt><strong>RUC (Tax ID):</strong></dt><dd class="description-text">20517426726</dd></div>
        <div>
          <dt><strong>Address:</strong></dt><dd class="description-text">
            Vittore Carpaccio 250, Of. 501, San Borja, Lima, Peru
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt><strong>Contact Email:</strong></dt><dd class="description-text">
            <a href="mailto:info@zcflow.com">info@zcflow.com</a>
          </dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
      <p>Hereinafter referred to as <strong>"the Company"</strong>.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>2. Personal Data We Collect</h2>
      <p>
        Depending on your interaction with the website or the ZCFLOW solution, the Company may
        collect:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Full name.</li>
        <li>ID document (when applicable).</li>
        <li>Email address and phone number.</li>
        <li>Professional and business information (company, position, and country).</li>
        <li>Information provided through contact forms or commercial processes.</li>
        <li>Data necessary for contractual or pre-contractual purposes.</li>
        <li>Technical information: IP address, browser type, operating system, and access logs.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="note">
        The Company does not request or process sensitive personal data. The user declares that the
        information provided is true, complete, and up to date.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>3. Purposes of Processing</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Responding to inquiries and contact requests.</li>
        <li>Managing the attraction and nurturing of commercial leads.</li>
        <li>Providing information about the ZCFLOW solution and associated services.</li>
        <li>Managing commercial, contractual, or pre-contractual relationships.</li>
        <li>Providing technical support and customer service.</li>
        <li>Managing authorized access, users, and profiles.</li>
        <li>Administering credentials and usage controls for the solution.</li>
        <li>Sending operational or commercial communications with consent.</li>
        <li>Analyzing website usage to improve user experience.</li>
        <li>Complying with legal and regulatory obligations.</li>
        <li>Developing commercial and promotional actions.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>4. Legal Basis for Processing</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Free, prior, express, and informed consent.</li>
        <li>Execution of a contractual or pre-contractual relationship.</li>
        <li>Compliance with legal obligations.</li>
        <li>
          Legitimate interest of the Company, provided it does not affect the data subject's rights.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>5. Data Retention</h2>
      <p>
        Data will be kept as long as necessary to fulfill the stated purposes, including potential
        or legitimate interest relationships.
      </p>
      <p>
        In contractual relationships, data will be kept for the duration of the contract and
        subsequent legal periods. Thereafter, data will be deleted, anonymized, or blocked in
        accordance with Law No. 29733.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>6. Information Security</h2>
      <p>
        We adopt reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect data from unauthorized
        access or loss, limiting access only to authorized personnel under confidentiality
        agreements.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>7. Data Processors and Transfers</h2>
      <p>We may share data with:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Technology providers necessary for operation.</li>
        <li>
          Companies within the <strong>SEIDOR group</strong> for administrative and commercial purposes.
        </li>
        <li>Strategic partners linked to ZCFLOW under confidentiality.</li>
        <li>Competent authorities as required by law.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not sell or transfer data indiscriminately to third parties.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>8. Data Subject Rights</h2>
      <p>
        The data subject may exercise their rights of: <strong
          >Access, Rectification, Cancellation / Erasure, and Opposition</strong
        >.
      </p>
      <p>
        Submit your request to <a href="mailto:info@zcflow.com">info@zcflow.com</a> with your full name
        and a clear description of the request, per Law No. 29733.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>9. Cookies and Similar Technologies</h2>
      <p>
        We use cookies to improve browsing. You can configure your browser to reject them, though
        this may affect site functionality.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>10. Modifications to the Privacy Policy</h2>
      <p>
        The Company reserves the right to modify this policy at any time. Changes become effective
        upon publication on the website.
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</LegalWrapper>
